Mobile APK Testing — Complete Guide
For testing Android APK files (native mobile apps), Playwright doesn't support this — it's only for web/browser testing. You need a different framework.

Best Framework: Appium + WebdriverIO (JavaScript)
Since you already know JavaScript and Playwright, the closest option is Appium — it works similarly with page objects, selectors, and assertions.

